    <node id="Screen">
      <data key="d0">Screen</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "screen" in this context refers to various web page components within a digital marketplace environment, each identified by unique IDs and titles, serving different purposes within the platform. Examples include the "home" screen titled "One Stop Market," which acts as the store's homepage, accessible via the URL "http://localhost:7770/". Another screen, labeled "cart_empty," represents an empty shopping cart, located at "http://localhost:7770/checkout/cart/", indicating the absence of items in the cart. Additionally, there is a "category" screen under the title "Electronics," which lists electronics products, accessible through the URL "http://localhost:7770/electronics.html". A "minicart_open" screen displays a mini-cart dropdown after an item has been added to the cart, with the URL pointing back to the homepage at "http://localhost:7770/". The "cart_with_item" screen shows the shopping cart after an item has been added, reflecting the updated cart contents.

Furthermore, other forms such as an "advanced search form," a "customer login form artifact," and a "guest orders and returns form screen" are also categorized under the term "screen." These forms serve specific functions within the platform, facilitating user interaction and navigation. Another example is the "search_empty" screen artifact with ID 'search_empty', title "Search results for: 'zzzxxyynotfound999'", and description 'Search with zero results', located at "http://localhost:7770/catalogsearch/result/?q=zzzxxyynotfound999". Additionally, there is a "subcategory" screen artifact with ID 'subcategory', title 'Cell Phones &amp; Accessories', described as a subcategory via navigation click from Electronics, and has a URL pointing to "http://localhost:7770/cell-phones-accessories.html". The "register" screen with the ID 'register', title 'Create New Customer Account', and a description 'Create customer account form', can be accessed at "http://localhost:7770/customer/account/create/". The "account_logged_in" screen artifact with ID 'account_logged_in', title 'My Account', and description 'My Account after UI login', is located at "http://localhost:7770/customer/account/". Lastly, the "search_results" screen artifact with ID 'search_results', title "Search results for: 'shirt'", and description "Search results for 'shirt'", is found at "http://localhost:7770/search?query=shirt".</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-1e655bdbe42e94b57b5af114fcde92d5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-10590a974d11935a433560ab608cc4ab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-18737c929f0e58f64d4f20637bd214c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-251472ea8351de945743e3a79d872336-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a4752269e7cb15e0bdf4bc87ed2fff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-36f6576613a283888b16c8f9146dbd71-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3881dc8d47b3676c7ac00352787e5b11-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6fee16de15adef8f9c158fcdcfc3c3cf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98635dbb5321900fe07ed4d39d07cf78-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e92b01bfe3c2300574d5d397bef740c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bc7fa509f6089f64c49c65f0ceb6b8ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d2a72d64e9d709b745758f4681df3ca6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dbbea0d67fc7a8a8d91f72b4050e0de3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e71e082796434ad5e7fdfd56adbca8ef-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ea805575f497a9c1254552acd0a1daf1-chunk-000</data>
