    </node>
    <node id="screen_id">
      <data key="d0">screen_id</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity "screen_id" is a versatile identifier used to denote different sections of a user interface, including the home screen and the search results screen. These screens play crucial roles in guiding user navigation and providing relevant information within the application. The home screen is a fundamental part of the user interface, serving as the starting point for navigation within the application. It is often the first screen users encounter when launching the app and has an associated ID, which can be either "home" or "search_results," depending on its function. This ID helps in locating and referencing specific parts of the interface programmatically.

The search results screen is another significant component of the interface, used to display the outcomes of a search query, providing users with relevant information or content. Like the home screen, it also has an ID, which can be "search_results" or "home," indicating its role in the overall structure of the application. The search results screen serves as a location identifier, facilitating easy access to the results through a unique ID.

Additionally, "screen_id" is a unique identifier for a screen in a user interface and can refer to a screen element with an ID of "search_results." It can also serve as a location identifier for the search results screen. Furthermore, there are mentions of "screen_id" being an identifier for a specific screen element, with values such as "search_advanced." Overall, "screen_id" is a critical component in defining and navigating through the various sections of a user interface, ensuring a seamless and efficient user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;A screen ID with the value 'subcategory'.&lt;SEP&gt;Unique identifier for a screen element&lt;SEP&gt;A screen ID with the value 'search_advanced'.&lt;SEP&gt;A screen element with ID 'search_advanced'</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-024b19b8de0d5b640f27f0a312da5ca5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-025c703964dec2fe371e10c8415dd613-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-035e7b9e2f8521711975d04dc94e090f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0ecdec2685406dc115c811677c195f75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1abb292a251278234ef2aea5585a4cec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b170fd51d9decb5d06c4423362c7e10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e69ba803ff29a691deb2111e022bb4d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-269a8ede147006aea65d5f4620f825e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-323e293277d50c431bbc02b71c78a7a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-336354e68363ca14a619dc9017f3722b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cb747e3acc9f125078ffdabdcabbc3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4d2253d679e093ecd355e3b749bc2b59-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-547a6ce3129ff5916eefb35f8a299993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-575df4d1d4a9a71fa3b40c1f3ed4f6be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-57700c1ee10803d54cfcb11e805a1b9e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ceb1c3b3128f0d47d1a8d177a4d6780-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6862f8705f500b582cfb681d1c6febc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79bdc8c15be295419534818b640a1fab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8192fe169bee4a5676a6db5cde9a3209-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c4c0287492ac47c15df9071249fde66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93994d22ad00beec814080e416a51904-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96f37bc024c1dd81bce2be42d32fb9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9ecd5e9d22535ece235c555f4d9df437-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a01aa3869759c0df193b39c39a682dfb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afaeae3f07222d6abb05167120cb64e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d28c12fec97088c620e43fae9ea0396c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d3f210baa22420bda082ab35ed47c513-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4dc81cdc7cc78005bebf5e2cebf18ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ee1aeda9c84d5b356cce352ae39e0746-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f9081d114c069483942bd32f623b7876-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fc1ca9cca3e46ee16fa32c18e0a103c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c33fc069142df72db73c0a60322bcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c9fc9ee30d9a60fd968f838ea162d4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-12452d2aa4a1f4053eb75846db92c28d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-194f81eb3c83c9cefd1db2a27051c77c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1c15c889a922325358d22d1c84770de1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2264c0cbd93197c10fe0a09fdbcf60f8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2425ff05274b38ff401705494a0d825c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-24628cc5a1143e502c68ca86491314b0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-268dbaf8f5d2bbfa508f8694007669e8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26e09db01a07794a9ce798e10694e907-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-27e21794880bc2e623ae59578cebcf4e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29be4ff47307e375f775296be1cde294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b681e6ff218bd5e8ea006e583399b46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2d10111161db5057f00b249baab62b6f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2f5966d424551de0ed4fd414c471d245-chunk-000</data>
