    <node id="instruction">
      <data key="d0">instruction</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "instruction" generally refers to various actions involving clicking on specific elements within a user interface. These instructions can include selecting items such as "Electronics," "Beauty &amp; Personal Care," or interacting with menu items, buttons, links, and comboboxes. An instruction typically involves clicking on a designated element to perform a specific action, such as searching for products or navigating through different categories. In some contexts, an instruction may also encompass the act of clicking to execute a broader method or action within a system. Instructions can be seen as commands to perform an action, actions to click a link, or sets of steps or commands given to a user. Examples of specific instructions include clicking the menu item "Sports &amp; Outdoors" or "Beauty &amp; Personal Care," and actions like signing in. Additionally, "click instruction" specifically refers to the act of clicking a menu item, while "clicking action to select 'Health &amp; Household'" is a more specific example of an instruction. A "set of instructions" encompasses a series of actions that need to be performed sequentially, often involving interactions with various elements on a user interface.&lt;SEP&gt;A command or set of instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;An instruction to click a menu item.&lt;SEP&gt;An instruction to click a link.&lt;SEP&gt;Set of actions to perform&lt;SEP&gt;An instruction to click the menu item 'Video Games'.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-024b19b8de0d5b640f27f0a312da5ca5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-035e7b9e2f8521711975d04dc94e090f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0ecdec2685406dc115c811677c195f75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1abb292a251278234ef2aea5585a4cec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b170fd51d9decb5d06c4423362c7e10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e69ba803ff29a691deb2111e022bb4d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-269a8ede147006aea65d5f4620f825e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-323e293277d50c431bbc02b71c78a7a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-336354e68363ca14a619dc9017f3722b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cb747e3acc9f125078ffdabdcabbc3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4d2253d679e093ecd355e3b749bc2b59-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-547a6ce3129ff5916eefb35f8a299993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-575df4d1d4a9a71fa3b40c1f3ed4f6be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-57700c1ee10803d54cfcb11e805a1b9e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ceb1c3b3128f0d47d1a8d177a4d6780-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6862f8705f500b582cfb681d1c6febc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79bdc8c15be295419534818b640a1fab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8192fe169bee4a5676a6db5cde9a3209-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c4c0287492ac47c15df9071249fde66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93994d22ad00beec814080e416a51904-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96f37bc024c1dd81bce2be42d32fb9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a01aa3869759c0df193b39c39a682dfb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afaeae3f07222d6abb05167120cb64e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d3f210baa22420bda082ab35ed47c513-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4dc81cdc7cc78005bebf5e2cebf18ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ee1aeda9c84d5b356cce352ae39e0746-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fc1ca9cca3e46ee16fa32c18e0a103c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c33fc069142df72db73c0a60322bcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c9fc9ee30d9a60fd968f838ea162d4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-12452d2aa4a1f4053eb75846db92c28d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-194f81eb3c83c9cefd1db2a27051c77c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1f7b2c3abc8d8d66c2f091d24f67233a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2264c0cbd93197c10fe0a09fdbcf60f8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2425ff05274b38ff401705494a0d825c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-268dbaf8f5d2bbfa508f8694007669e8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26e09db01a07794a9ce798e10694e907-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-27e21794880bc2e623ae59578cebcf4e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29be4ff47307e375f775296be1cde294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b681e6ff218bd5e8ea006e583399b46-chunk-000</data>
