    <node id="name">
      <data key="d0">name</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity "name" is described across various contexts, including its role as an electronic device, a button labeled "Search," a link with a placeholder text for its name, another link with a specific name, a menu item, a combobox, and a menu item named "Sports &amp; Outdoors." These descriptions collectively highlight the multifaceted nature of "name," indicating it could be a component of a user interface or a system where different elements have distinct labels and functions. Additionally, "name" is also referenced as a label or title of an element, a sign-in option, the name of the menu item "Beauty &amp; Personal Care," a link name, a general term for a name or label, and a concept related to the name of the combobox. The entity "name" is further described as the label or title of an item, and it is associated with the menu items "Beauty &amp; Personal Care," "Sports &amp; Outdoors," "Clothing, Shoes &amp; Jewelry," "Home &amp; Kitchen," "Office Products," and "Tools &amp; Home Improvement."&lt;SEP&gt;The name of the link being clicked.&lt;SEP&gt;Name of an HTML element&lt;SEP&gt;The name of the menu item 'Video Games'.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-024b19b8de0d5b640f27f0a312da5ca5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0ecdec2685406dc115c811677c195f75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1abb292a251278234ef2aea5585a4cec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b170fd51d9decb5d06c4423362c7e10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-269a8ede147006aea65d5f4620f825e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-323e293277d50c431bbc02b71c78a7a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-336354e68363ca14a619dc9017f3722b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4d2253d679e093ecd355e3b749bc2b59-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-547a6ce3129ff5916eefb35f8a299993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-57700c1ee10803d54cfcb11e805a1b9e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ceb1c3b3128f0d47d1a8d177a4d6780-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6862f8705f500b582cfb681d1c6febc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79bdc8c15be295419534818b640a1fab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8192fe169bee4a5676a6db5cde9a3209-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96f37bc024c1dd81bce2be42d32fb9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a01aa3869759c0df193b39c39a682dfb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afaeae3f07222d6abb05167120cb64e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fc1ca9cca3e46ee16fa32c18e0a103c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c33fc069142df72db73c0a60322bcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-12452d2aa4a1f4053eb75846db92c28d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-194f81eb3c83c9cefd1db2a27051c77c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1f7b2c3abc8d8d66c2f091d24f67233a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2425ff05274b38ff401705494a0d825c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-268dbaf8f5d2bbfa508f8694007669e8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26e09db01a07794a9ce798e10694e907-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-27e21794880bc2e623ae59578cebcf4e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29be4ff47307e375f775296be1cde294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b681e6ff218bd5e8ea006e583399b46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2d10111161db5057f00b249baab62b6f-chunk-000</data>
