    <node id="bbox_px">
      <data key="d0">bbox_px</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">bbox_px refers to the bounding box coordinates of various graphical elements such as buttons, links, and menu items, measured in pixels. This term specifically denotes the pixel coordinates of the bounding box for a button, a link, and a menu item, indicating the area encompassing these interactive elements on a screen. It ensures accurate placement and sizing of graphical components in digital interfaces. bbox_px can also refer to the pixel coordinates of the combobox, a bounding box in pixel coordinates, bounding box coordinates, bounding box coordinates in pixels, bounding box coordinates in pixel units, and bounding box pixel coordinates for the product image container. Pixel coordinates of the menu item 'Beauty &amp; Personal Care' and pixel coordinates of the combobox are mentioned, further emphasizing the use of bbox_px in specifying precise locations and dimensions of graphical elements in digital interfaces. Additionally, bounding box coordinates in pixel units and bounding box coordinates in pixels are mentioned, reinforcing the concept of using pixel-based measurements for bounding boxes.&lt;SEP&gt;Bounding box coordinates in pixels.&lt;SEP&gt;Bounding box coordinates in pixels&lt;SEP&gt;Bounding box coordinates in pixels for the menu item 'Video Games'.&lt;SEP&gt;Bounding box coordinates of the textbox</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-024b19b8de0d5b640f27f0a312da5ca5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-035e7b9e2f8521711975d04dc94e090f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0b695dbca7b0baea8472f4b9b8c77cc7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0ecdec2685406dc115c811677c195f75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1abb292a251278234ef2aea5585a4cec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b170fd51d9decb5d06c4423362c7e10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1c39a269c840c652393b3da52117ee29-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e69ba803ff29a691deb2111e022bb4d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-269a8ede147006aea65d5f4620f825e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-323e293277d50c431bbc02b71c78a7a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-336354e68363ca14a619dc9017f3722b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cb747e3acc9f125078ffdabdcabbc3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4d2253d679e093ecd355e3b749bc2b59-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-547a6ce3129ff5916eefb35f8a299993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-575df4d1d4a9a71fa3b40c1f3ed4f6be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-57700c1ee10803d54cfcb11e805a1b9e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ceb1c3b3128f0d47d1a8d177a4d6780-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6862f8705f500b582cfb681d1c6febc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6fdf98cdebdbf6d580bc571f0e63d026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79bdc8c15be295419534818b640a1fab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8192fe169bee4a5676a6db5cde9a3209-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c4c0287492ac47c15df9071249fde66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93994d22ad00beec814080e416a51904-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96f37bc024c1dd81bce2be42d32fb9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a01aa3869759c0df193b39c39a682dfb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afaeae3f07222d6abb05167120cb64e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d3f210baa22420bda082ab35ed47c513-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4dc81cdc7cc78005bebf5e2cebf18ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ee1aeda9c84d5b356cce352ae39e0746-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fc1ca9cca3e46ee16fa32c18e0a103c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c33fc069142df72db73c0a60322bcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c9fc9ee30d9a60fd968f838ea162d4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-12452d2aa4a1f4053eb75846db92c28d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-194f81eb3c83c9cefd1db2a27051c77c-chun