    <node id="a11y">
      <data key="d0">a11y</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "a11y" is an abbreviation for accessibility, a multifaceted approach aimed at ensuring that digital content and interfaces are usable by individuals with disabilities. It encompasses both technical aspects, such as accessibility features and user interface elements, and organizational affiliations dedicated to accessibility initiatives. The term is commonly used to describe accessibility in various contexts, including source elements for accessibility instructions. For instance, in a screen interaction with ID "home," the term "a11y" might refer to a clickable link with detailed instructions and bounding box positions, such as the "Belle Of The Ball Princess Sprinkle Mix" link, which has a role of "link" and a bounding box position of [779, 674, 1002, 793]. Similarly, in another screen interaction with ID "search_results," the term could relate to accessibility features for web applications, such as instructions to click the menu for different categories. Additionally, "a11y" is associated with an organization focused on accessibility initiatives, highlighting its significance in promoting digital inclusivity. The term is also linked to accessibility-related elements and methods, further underscoring its importance in enhancing usability for people with disabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;[a11y] is a term related to accessibility and usability in web development.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-035e7b9e2f8521711975d04dc94e090f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0b695dbca7b0baea8472f4b9b8c77cc7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1abb292a251278234ef2aea5585a4cec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b170fd51d9decb5d06c4423362c7e10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b896baf2b5d815d3bbe0eb625a72814-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1c39a269c840c652393b3da52117ee29-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e69ba803ff29a691deb2111e022bb4d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b63eb4098e5145f7df0c3032404516e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cb747e3acc9f125078ffdabdcabbc3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4d2253d679e093ecd355e3b749bc2b59-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-53f6ded76ac80a02287a2f5e4d7808cb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-575df4d1d4a9a71fa3b40c1f3ed4f6be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-57700c1ee10803d54cfcb11e805a1b9e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ceb1c3b3128f0d47d1a8d177a4d6780-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6fdf98cdebdbf6d580bc571f0e63d026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6fee16de15adef8f9c158fcdcfc3c3cf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ff218daa648cf801a7184502db5ca24-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8192fe169bee4a5676a6db5cde9a3209-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c4c0287492ac47c15df9071249fde66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93994d22ad00beec814080e416a51904-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98635dbb5321900fe07ed4d39d07cf78-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-998ef6f2a08b055f4cea5fd640aa78ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9fde1622ef828bc2735ced9dd67f3e79-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a01aa3869759c0df193b39c39a682dfb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afaeae3f07222d6abb05167120cb64e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b749abb1d006250866dea057553594bc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d2a72d64e9d709b745758f4681df3ca6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d3f210baa22420bda082ab35ed47c513-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-de35d1ab540844b78d0adaeb5ebb47a3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4dc81cdc7cc78005bebf5e2cebf18ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e82d1c6e818db2c2331a5e7d9a0ef845-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ee1aeda9c84d5b356cce352ae39e0746-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f694070ad6fd98c3c0c4b0a9c3787bbb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-015b8caaec6a57269904cd96648a584a-chun