    <edge source="instruction" target="role">
      <data key="d7">64.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The instruction to click the button is related to its role, which involves performing a specific action. This action can be described as a click, whether it is on a button, a link labeled "Create an Account," a menu item, or a combobox. The role of the action is to indicate the purpose behind the click, such as creating an account, navigating through a menu, or interacting with a combobox. The instruction emphasizes the variety of contexts in which the click action can occur, including clicking on the menu item "Sports &amp; Outdoors" and the link role. Additionally, there is an instruction to click on the menu item "Beauty &amp; Personal Care." The overall instruction revolves around executing a click action, which serves different purposes depending on the specific element being interacted with. The instruction is related to the role of clicking, and the action of clicking a button to perform a search is also mentioned.&lt;SEP&gt;The instruction to click the role.&lt;SEP&gt;Action performed on role&lt;SEP&gt;The instruction to click the menu item 'Video Games' is related to its role.</data>
      <data key="d9">Purpose,applied to,click,link</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-0ecdec2685406dc115c811677c195f75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1abb292a251278234ef2aea5585a4cec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b170fd51d9decb5d06c4423362c7e10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-269a8ede147006aea65d5f4620f825e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-323e293277d50c431bbc02b71c78a7a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-336354e68363ca14a619dc9017f3722b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-547a6ce3129ff5916eefb35f8a299993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-575df4d1d4a9a71fa3b40c1f3ed4f6be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ceb1c3b3128f0d47d1a8d177a4d6780-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6862f8705f500b582cfb681d1c6febc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79bdc8c15be295419534818b640a1fab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8192fe169bee4a5676a6db5cde9a3209-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96f37bc024c1dd81bce2be42d32fb9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afaeae3f07222d6abb05167120cb64e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4dc81cdc7cc78005bebf5e2cebf18ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fc1ca9cca3e46ee16fa32c18e0a103c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c33fc069142df72db73c0a60322bcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-12452d2aa4a1f4053eb75846db92c28d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-194f81eb3c83c9cefd1db2a27051c77c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2264c0cbd93197c10fe0a09fdbcf60f8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-268dbaf8f5d2bbfa508f8694007669e8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26e09db01a07794a9ce798e10694e907-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-27e21794880bc2e623ae59578cebcf4e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29be4ff47307e375f775296be1cde294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b681e6ff218bd5e8ea006e583399b46-chunk-000</data>
