    <edge source="instruction" target="name">
      <data key="d7">57.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The instruction to click the button is related to its name, which can be interpreted as a command to perform a click action. This action involves selecting various menu items, such as "Sports &amp; Outdoors" or interacting with a combobox labeled "Search entire store here...". Additionally, there is an instruction to click on the menu item named "Sports &amp; Outdoors" itself, indicating a specific interaction point within a digital interface. The action of clicking also encompasses signing in, suggesting it may be part of a larger sequence of user interactions. Another instruction specifies clicking the menu item "Beauty &amp; Personal Care," highlighting the versatility of the click action across different categories. Furthermore, there are instructions to click on links named "My Account" and to perform the action of clicking a button labeled "Search." These actions collectively demonstrate the multifaceted nature of the click operation, encompassing navigation, selection, and user authentication within a digital environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The instruction to click the name.&lt;SEP&gt;Action performed on name&lt;SEP&gt;The instruction to click the menu item 'Video Games' is related to its name.</data>
      <data key="d9">Purpose,click,link,select,sign_in</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-0ecdec2685406dc115c811677c195f75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b170fd51d9decb5d06c4423362c7e10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-269a8ede147006aea65d5f4620f825e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-323e293277d50c431bbc02b71c78a7a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-336354e68363ca14a619dc9017f3722b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-547a6ce3129ff5916eefb35f8a299993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ceb1c3b3128f0d47d1a8d177a4d6780-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6862f8705f500b582cfb681d1c6febc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79bdc8c15be295419534818b640a1fab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96f37bc024c1dd81bce2be42d32fb9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afaeae3f07222d6abb05167120cb64e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fc1ca9cca3e46ee16fa32c18e0a103c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c33fc069142df72db73c0a60322bcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-194f81eb3c83c9cefd1db2a27051c77c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-268dbaf8f5d2bbfa508f8694007669e8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26e09db01a07794a9ce798e10694e907-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-27e21794880bc2e623ae59578cebcf4e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29be4ff47307e375f775296be1cde294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b681e6ff218bd5e8ea006e583399b46-chunk-000</data>
