    <edge source="role" target="name">
      <data key="d7">126.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The entity "name" plays a crucial role in defining the function and purpose of various elements such as buttons, links, and comboboxes. The relationship between the name and role of these elements is reciprocal, where the name often reflects the role and vice versa. For instance, a button labeled "Search entire store here..." clearly indicates its role as a combobox, suggesting it is designed for inputting search queries. Similarly, a link named "My Account" is associated with a specific role, implying it leads to account-related functionalities. The term "role" is also used interchangeably with "name," indicating that the label of an element can define its function and vice versa. This duality highlights the importance of clear naming conventions in user interfaces to enhance usability and accessibility.&lt;SEP&gt;To fulfill accessibility role&lt;SEP&gt;To perform the action of clicking&lt;SEP&gt;click the link 'Advanced Search'&lt;SEP&gt;The role to click the name.&lt;SEP&gt;Action performed on role and name&lt;SEP&gt;The role of the menu item 'Video Games' is related to its name.</data>
      <data key="d9">Advanced Search,Purpose,click,defines,has_role,is,is associated with,link,represents</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-0ecdec2685406dc115c811677c195f75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b170fd51d9decb5d06c4423362c7e10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-336354e68363ca14a619dc9017f3722b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6862f8705f500b582cfb681d1c6febc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8192fe169bee4a5676a6db5cde9a3209-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afaeae3f07222d6abb05167120cb64e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c33fc069142df72db73c0a60322bcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-12452d2aa4a1f4053eb75846db92c28d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26e09db01a07794a9ce798e10694e907-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29be4ff47307e375f775296be1cde294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b681e6ff218bd5e8ea006e583399b46-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1787083902</data>
