    </edge>
    <edge source="role" target="bbox_px">
      <data key="d7">84.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The role of the button, as described, is represented by its bounding box. This role is further specified when it pertains to the "My Account" link, where the bounding box is assigned to this specific role. The role also serves to fulfill accessibility requirements and to perform the action of clicking. Additionally, the role involves performing actions on both the bounding box and the role itself. Furthermore, the role of the menu item 'Video Games' is linked to its bounding box coordinates, indicating that the role is defined by the spatial location of the menu item.</data>
      <data key="d9">Purpose,click,link,represents</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-0ecdec2685406dc115c811677c195f75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afaeae3f07222d6abb05167120cb64e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c33fc069142df72db73c0a60322bcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26e09db01a07794a9ce798e10694e907-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29be4ff47307e375f775296be1cde294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b681e6ff218bd5e8ea006e583399b46-chunk-000</data>
